https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/powerhouses-for-fake-meat-muscle-protein-can-now-be-grown-in-chloroplasts-of-lettuce-and-tobacco-plants.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 01:31:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/powerhouses-for-fake-meat-muscle-protein-can-now-be-grown-in-chloroplasts-of-lettuce-and-tobacco-plants</guid></item><item><title>2001年诺贝尔物理学奖</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nobel-prize-in-physics-2001</link><description>我们周围的物质由遵守量子力学定律的原子组成。在正常温度下，这些通常符合经典概念，并且在这些条件下气体的行为很像一群台球在彼此和包含的墙壁上弹跳。然而，当温度降低且原子速度降低时，它们的性质将越来越受到量子力学原理的支配。原子绕其轴旋转——它们具有自旋——这种运动由自旋量子数描述，该量子数必须是整数（整数）或半整数。具有整数自旋的粒子称为&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nobel-prize-in-physics-2001.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 01:16:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nobel-prize-in-physics-2001</guid></item><item><title>Piezo2 张力灵敏度及其通过选择性拼接的调制</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/piezo2-tension-sensitivity-and-its-modulation-by-alternative-splicing</link><description>Sindoni 及其同事证明，选择性剪接可调节力门控离子通道 Piezo2 的灵敏度。他们将外显子 35 确定为足以实现最大机械灵敏度的结构域。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/piezo2-tension-sensitivity-and-its-modulation-by-alternative-splicing2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 01:01:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/piezo2-tension-sensitivity-and-its-modulation-by-alternative-splicing</guid></item><item><title>对上呼吸道感染和神经退行性疾病中 ROCKJAKSTAT 信号通路的新见解</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/novel-insights-into-the-rockjakstat-signaling-pathway-in-upper-respiratory-tract-infections-and-neurodegenerative-diseases</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:46:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/novel-insights-into-the-rockjakstat-signaling-pathway-in-upper-respiratory-tract-infections-and-neurodegenerative-diseases</guid></item><item><title>苏丹喀土穆专科中心肾移植受者再入院的频率和原因 一项横断面研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/frequency-and-causes-of-hospital-readmissions-among-postkidney-transplant-recipients-at-specialized-centers-in-khartoum-sudan-a-crosssectional-study</link><description>抽象的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/frequency-and-causes-of-hospital-readmissions-among-postkidney-transplant-recipients-at-specialized-centers-in-khartoum-sudan-a-crosssectional-study.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:31:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/frequency-and-causes-of-hospital-readmissions-among-postkidney-transplant-recipients-at-specialized-centers-in-khartoum-sudan-a-crosssectional-study</guid></item><item><title>铁或多种微量营养素粉补充剂对马拉维农村儿童进行化学预防疟疾：研究摘要</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/iron-or-multiple-micronutrient-powder-supplements-with-malaria-chemoprevention-in-rural-malawian-children-research-summary</link><description>这项研究评估了在马拉维农村地区，普遍补充铁剂和疟疾化学预防 (MC) 是否可以改善儿童认知结果，并且对于感染风险是否安全。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/iron-or-multiple-micronutrient-powder-supplements-with-malaria-chemoprevention-in-rural-malawian-children-research-summary2.png" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:16:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/iron-or-multiple-micronutrient-powder-supplements-with-malaria-chemoprevention-in-rural-malawian-children-research-summary</guid></item><item><title>基因编辑狗缺乏引起过敏的蛋白质</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/geneedited-dogs-lack-the-protein-that-causes-allergies</link><description>一家公司培育出了不含引起过敏的主要蛋白质的狗，并希望获得批准开始销售它们&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/geneedited-dogs-lack-the-protein-that-causes-allergies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:01:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/geneedited-dogs-lack-the-protein-that-causes-allergies</guid></item><item><title>发现揭示衰老的人类大脑从血液中获得免疫细胞强化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/discovery-reveals-aging-human-brains-receive-immune-cell-reinforcements-from-blood</link><description>长期以来，人们一直认为大脑的免疫系统独立于身体的其他部分而存在，拥有自己的专门免疫细胞和限制进入大脑的血脑屏障。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/discovery-reveals-aging-human-brains-receive-immune-cell-reinforcements-from-blood2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 23:46:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/discovery-reveals-aging-human-brains-receive-immune-cell-reinforcements-from-blood</guid></item></channel></rss>